{"unit_id":"harryopo__dsh-cloud-workspaces#card-zh","repo":"harryopo/dsh-cloud-workspaces","commit":"aa8e9fd275ba2d6a512caa86f31105dfc4ab5462","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cloud-workspaces（DSH 插件，Web 工作区与开发工具）：把 DSH 会话连接到用户配置的 Linux SSH 主机。它在工作区选择器提供云端目录浏览与绑定，并按会话将 bash、read、write、edit、glob、grep 等工具路由到远端。另提供主机设置、显式 SSH 工具、连接复用、跳板机和端口隧道，也支持将长命令作为后台任务运行。适合需要在远程服务器上查看、编辑和运行项目的 DSH 用户；需要配置可访问的 SSH 主机。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:48-119","src/session-tools.ts:489-549","src/engine.ts:467-530"]}
{"unit_id":"harryopo__dsh-cloud-workspaces#card-en","repo":"harryopo/dsh-cloud-workspaces","commit":"aa8e9fd275ba2d6a512caa86f31105dfc4ab5462","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-cloud-workspaces is a DSH web plugin for using remote Linux workspaces over SSH. It adds remote folder browsing and workspace binding, routes session file and shell tools to the selected host, and provides SSH tools, jump hosts, tunnels and background commands. Configure an SSH host to use it.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:48-119","src/session-tools.ts:489-549","src/engine.ts:467-530"]}
